<title>HONG KONG: HK's KCRC announces senior appointments.</title>
<headline>HK's KCRC announces senior appointments.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kowloon-Canton Railway Corp said in a statement on Wednesday James Blake has joined the company as senior director.</p>
<p>Jeffrey Cheung, who will join the company on April 7, will become corporate treasurer with the title deputy director of finance.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
